        "text": "Destack modules can contain (up to) one module { ... } declaration block, which carries decorators that apply to the whole source module. @noHeap module {} Module metadata such as the role, labels, product, active derives, or tree builder comes from the compiler / target / profile configuration and is read through import.meta .",
